မြန်မာအဘိဓာန်</span> အတွဲ-<span class=\"volume\">၂၃ </span> </p>","word":""},{"book_id":1,"definition":"<p class=\"word\"> သိက္ခိတဗ္ဗပဒ <span class=\"gender\">(န)</span> </p>\n<div class=viggaha>\n<p><span class=\"word_break\">[သိက္ခိတဗ္ဗ + ပဒ]</span> <span class=\"reference\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"definition\">\n<p>ကျင့်-ဖြည့်ကျင့်- ပြည့်စေ-အပ်သောတရားအစု။</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"source\"><span class=\"name\">တိပိဋကပါဠိ-မြန်မာအဘိဓာန်</span> အတွဲ-<span class=\"volume\">၂၃ </span> </p>","word":""},{"book_id":1,"definition":"<p class=\"word\"> သိက္ခိတဗ္ဗဘာဂ <span class=\"gender\">( ပု)</span></p>\n<div class=viggaha>\n<p><span class=\"word_break\">[သိက္ခိတဗ္ဗ + ဘာဂ]</span> <span class=\"reference\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"definition\">\n<p>သိက္ခိတဗ္ဗပဒ - ကြည့်။</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"source\"><span class=\"name\">တိပိဋကပါဠိ-မြန်မာအဘိဓာန်</span> အတွဲ-<span class=\"volume\">၂၃ </span> </p>","word":""},{"book_id":1,"definition":"<p class=\"word\"> သိက္ခိတဗ္ဗယုတ္တ <span class=\"gender\">(တိ)</span> </p>\n<div class=viggaha>\n<p><span class=\"word_break\">[သိက္ခိတဗ္ဗ + ယုတ္တ]</span> <span class=\"reference\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"definition\">\n<p>သင်ယူ-လေ့ကျင့်-အပ်သည်နှင့်ယှဉ်သော။ </p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"source\"><span class=\"name\">တိပိဋကပါဠိ-မြန်မာအဘိဓာန်</span> အတွဲ-<span class=\"volume\">၂၃ </span> </p>","word":""},{"book_id":1,"definition":"<p class=\"word\"> သိက္ခိတဗ္ဗယုတ္တက <span class=\"gender\">(တိ)</span> </p>\n<div class=viggaha>\n<p><span class=\"word_break\">[သိက္ခိတဗ္ဗယုတ္တ + က]</span> <span class=\"reference\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"definition\">\n<p>သိက္ခိတဗ္ဗယုတ္တ-ကြည့်။ </p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"source\"><span class=\"name\">တိပိဋကပါဠိ-မြန်မာအဘိဓာန်</span> အတွဲ-<span class=\"volume\">၂၃ </span> </p>","word":""},{"book_id":1,"definition":"<p class=\"word\"> သိက္ခိတဗ္ဗယုတ္တကပရိယတ္တိ <span class=\"gender\">(ထီ)</span></p>\n<div class=viggaha>\n<p><span class=\"word_break\">[သိက္ခိတဗ္ဗ - ယုတ္တက + ပရိယတ္တိ]</span> <span class=\"reference\"></spa